// ==============================================================================
// AXON PROPRIETARY NATIVE WEBVIEW & ZERO-CHROMIUM PHOTON HOST (`std/webview.ax`)
// Dual-Core Desktop Application Architecture:
//   1. Engine 1 (`WEBVIEW_ENGINE_AXON_PHOTON`): 100% Zero-Chromium Proprietary Axon Photon-D2D
//      Engine (Direct2D + DirectWrite + HTML5/CSS3/JS/Tailwind) — ~4 MB RAM (100x lighter than
//      Chromium!), 0.00% idle CPU, native Axon HICON, zero browser dependency, zero localhost port!
//   2. Engine 2 (`WEBVIEW_ENGINE_NATIVE_HOST`): Hardened Proprietary Axon Native WebView Host —
//      * Zero Globe Icon: Synthesizes real 32x32 32-bit BGRA `.ico` (`/favicon.ico`) + inline SVG
//        icon injection + Win32 `WM_SETICON` (`ICON_SMALL`/`ICON_BIG`) + DWM Dark Titlebar!
//      * Zero `cmd.exe` Flash: 100% native Win32 `CreateProcessA` (`CREATE_NO_WINDOW`) + Win32 Job
//        Object (`JOB_OBJECT_LIMIT_KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE`) + native Win32 recursive profile wipe with retry!
//      * Zero-Trust Security: 128-bit CSPRNG `X-Axon-Token` (constant-time `ct_eq`), HTTP Request
//        Smuggling (`Transfer-Encoding`) rejection, 16 KB header cap, method allowlist, strict CSP /
//        `nosniff` / `DENY` / `same-origin` headers, `Sec-Fetch-Site` shield, CWE-78 binary/profile
//        whitelist, CWE-22 + Windows reserved device name (`CON`/`NUL`/`COM1..9`) guard!
// ==============================================================================

